*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0027
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-02-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 807
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0027.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FEE0027C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 FEE-WAIVED         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2200-CONCESSIONS
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVED=" FEE-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
2200-CONCESSIONS.
    IF TX-STUDENT-IND = 'Y' AND TX-CUST-AGE < 24
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
        MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
    ELSE IF TX-CUST-AGE >= 65
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
        MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
    ELSE
        MOVE 9 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-IF
    END-IF.
